\ A recursive word that reaches its recursion through a non-tail `dip`.
\
\ `r` is the last word of the `dip` body, so it is a tail call on the trampoline `dip` already
\ entered and adds no entry of its own. Each level is the `if` arm `when` runs in tail position
\ and one `dip` body entered by a native in non-tail position.

r: stack-recursive ( n -- n ) [ dup 0 > [ 1 - 0 [ r ] dip + 1 + ] when ] ;

12 r drop
